/Title (Multi signal deterioration Higher distress_signal_count, combining losses + leverage + weak coverage simultaneously. Negative or near-zero profit margin  Sustained losses visible in multiple years, not a single anomalous year. Poor interest coverage  EBIT below financial expense burden, making refinancing increasingly difficult. Key insight: Bankruptcy leaves fingerprints. Broader distress across dimensions makes the strongest signal.)
