/Title (Predicted probability close to threshold  Most FN cases sit just below the decision boundary, not at low probability. Financially ambiguous  Higher current_ratio, lower debt_to_assets vs. captured bankruptcies. They looked healthier. Weaker distress signal count  Fewer simultaneous red flags. The failure was narrower  \(often one acute shock rather than broad deterioration\). Key insight: The model is not systematically wrong  \(it's facing genuinely hard cases at the margin\).)
